WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.680
This is one agent's visit to an online store, seen three ways. First, the customer.

2
00:00:05.680 --> 00:00:14.180
You ask your AI agent to find a quiet air purifier, and buy the best one.

3
00:00:14.180 --> 00:00:23.680
Before it goes, you sign a delegation: what it may do, where, and how much it can spend without asking.

4
00:00:23.680 --> 00:00:37.680
At the store's front door, Silvector greets your agent, assesses it, verifies who it is and who sent it, permits it within your limits, and logs every step.

5
00:00:37.680 --> 00:00:47.680
Inside, your agent compares options at full speed. The quietest one costs $349, above your limit.

6
00:00:47.680 --> 00:00:57.680
So Silvector asks you to step up. One tap to confirm. Nothing above your limit happens without you.

7
00:00:57.680 --> 00:01:07.680
You get a plain-English receipt. The store gets the same one, signed, so both sides can see what happened.

8
00:01:07.680 --> 00:01:12.180
Your agent. Your rules. Your receipt.

9
00:01:12.180 --> 00:01:17.167
Silvector. Seen, decided, signed.

